Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:37.50,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,481)\fnFZLanTingHei-H-GBK\fs30\c&H483538&\4c&H82847E&\bord3\shad3\3c&HFEFEFE&\pos(1033.854,272.19)}源頭鋁的量發生了變化？
